{"4568270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Biosphere", "steam_appid": 4568270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project Biosphere</strong> is a real-time ecosystem sandbox built on a falling-sand simulation. Water flows, heat spreads, fire consumes, plants take root. Ecosystems rise and fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/65d52f0dc25067c639e5c328bb659694.avif?t=1777049594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras_big/65d52f0dc25067c639e5c328bb659694.webp?t=1777049594 width=1560 height=327 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Relax, waste some time, and let out some steam. With no set goal, Project Biosphere is simply a toy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/eec2f0cc4975917d940784c176b89a92.poster.avif?t=1777049594\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/eec2f0cc4975917d940784c176b89a92.webm?t=1777049594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/eec2f0cc4975917d940784c176b89a92.mp4?t=1777049594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the terrain, choose a world preset, and experiment with a living simulation where every material interacts. Dry worlds burn. Wet worlds flood. Rich soil blooms. Harsh conditions choke growth. Small changes can ripple outward.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/4e300195b61d52e4e85d1aeba1e94a87.avif?t=1777049594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras_big/4e300195b61d52e4e85d1aeba1e94a87.webp?t=1777049594 width=1560 height=327 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by 2D falling-sand games, we're bringing the idea to life in 3D. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch life take hold, from single celled-organisms to multi-cellular life, the evolution simulation makes the sandbox come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/10403d55b306ed923fa6cc39f7d4168f.poster.avif?t=1777049594\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/10403d55b306ed923fa6cc39f7d4168f.webm?t=1777049594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/10403d55b306ed923fa6cc39f7d4168f.mp4?t=1777049594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the Environment, raise and lower abmient temperature and watch the world turn to an inferno. Increase pressure, humidity or switch gravity negative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/5354eff99451097dc46aaa4c5eb4f895.poster.avif?t=1777049594\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568270/extras/5354eff99451097dc46aaa4c5eb4f895.webm?t=1777049594\" type=\